---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="YT to M4A – High-quality YouTube audio trim | Ozarbox" description="Extract authorized YouTube audio to M4A, remove the first 12 seconds, and download the result using free GitHub Actions.">
  <section class="container tool-wrap">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Home</a> / <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'categories/'}>Tools</a> / YT to M4A</nav>
    <header class="tool-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ozarbox · Audio tools</p>
      <h1>YT to M4A</h1>
      <p>Extract the best available audio from a YouTube video, remove its first 12 seconds, and download an M4A file. Processing runs on a free GitHub Actions runner—Ozarbox does not operate or pay for a separate server.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="tool-box" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
      <h2 id="steps-title">Convert YouTube audio</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><strong>Paste your YouTube link</strong><span>Use a standard video URL, including youtu.be links.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Start conversion on GitHub</strong><span>GitHub securely accepts the URL without exposing an access token in this website.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Download the M4A artifact</strong><span>When the run finishes, open its Artifacts section and download <code>yt-to-m4a-audio</code>.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <form id="yt-form">
        <label for="youtube-url">YouTube video URL</label>
        <input id="youtube-url" name="youtube-url" type="url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." autocomplete="url" required>
        <p id="url-error" class="error" role="alert" hidden>Enter a valid YouTube video URL.</p>
        <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Continue to free conversion on GitHub ↗</button>
      </form>
      <p class="note"><strong>Why does GitHub open?</strong> GitHub Pages is static and cannot securely start a private processing job by itself. This GitHub Actions workflow is the free, token-safe way to run yt-dlp and FFmpeg without exposing a secret in your browser. On GitHub, select <em>Run workflow</em>, paste the same URL into the input, and start the run.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="details">
      <h2>Output settings</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Format: M4A container with AAC audio.</li>
        <li>Source: best available audio stream.</li>
        <li>Trim: starts at 00:12.000 (first 12 seconds removed).</li>
        <li>Quality: preserves the original AAC stream when possible; otherwise encodes AAC at 256 kb/s.</li>
        <li>Temporary output: GitHub Actions artifact, retained for 1 day.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal">Use this tool only for videos you own or have permission to download, and in compliance with applicable copyright law and YouTube's terms. Availability can also depend on YouTube's access restrictions.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
  <script>
    const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#yt-form');
    const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#youtube-url');
    const error = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#url-error');
    const workflow = 'https://github.com/ajayawana/tool-platform/actions/workflows/yt-to-m4a.yml';
    form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const value = input?.value.trim() || '';
      let parsed: URL;
      try { parsed = new URL(value); } catch { if (error) error.hidden = false; return; }
      const host = parsed.hostname.toLowerCase();
      const validHost = ['youtube.com','www.youtube.com','m.youtube.com','music.youtube.com','youtu.be'].includes(host);
      const hasVideo = host === 'youtu.be' ? parsed.pathname.length > 1 : Boolean(parsed.searchParams.get('v') || parsed.pathname.startsWith('/shorts/'));
      if (!validHost || !hasVideo) { if (error) error.hidden = false; return; }
      if (error) error.hidden = true;
      try { navigator.clipboard?.writeText(value); } catch {}
      window.open(workflow, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
    });
  </script>
  <style>
    .breadcrumbs{font-size:.9rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:20px}.breadcrumbs a{color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:none}
    .tool-head{max-width:820px}.tool-head h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.08;margin:.2em 0}.tool-head>p:last-child{color:#475569;font-size:1.08rem}
    .tool-box,.details{max-width:820px;margin-top:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe3ee;border-radius:20px;padding:26px}
    .tool-box h2,.details h2{margin-top:0}.steps{padding-left:22px;display:grid;gap:14px}.steps li span{display:block;color:#64748b;font-size:.94rem}
    #yt-form{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}#yt-form label{font-weight:800}#youtube-url{width:100%;padding:14px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:11px;font:inherit}
    #yt-form .primary-button{border:0;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;width:fit-content;white-space:normal}#yt-form .primary-button:hover{background:#1d4ed8}
    .note,.legal{margin-top:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-size:.9rem}.error{color:#b91c1c;margin:0}
    .details li{margin:8px 0}.legal{background:#fff7ed;color:#7c2d12}
    @media(max-width:600px){.tool-box,.details{padding:19px}#yt-form .primary-button{width:100%}}
  </style>
</Layout>
